{"id":"faef5fc9871e143c","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-branch.md","title":"Proof Branch","display":"df-proof-branch — Proof Branch","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-branch","aliases":["72-df-proof-branch"],"display":"df-proof-branch — Proof Branch","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-tree]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §§1.2.1–1.2.2; print10–12/PDF22–24; explicit local encoding","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-branch"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-branch</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-branch — Proof Branch"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §§1.2.1–1.2.2; print10–12/PDF22–24; explicit local encoding"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\">\\(\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\\)</span>；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\preceq v\">\\(u\\preceq v\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=v\\lor u\\prec v\">\\(u=v\\lor u\\prec v\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Branch}(\\pi):=\\{b\\subseteq D:\\forall u,v\\in b\\ (u\\preceq v\\lor v\\preceq u)\\land\\forall c\\subseteq D\\ ((b\\subseteq c\\land\\forall u,v\\in c\\ (u\\preceq v\\lor v\\preceq u))\\to c=b)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Branch}(\\pi):=\\{b\\subseteq D:\\forall u,v\\in b\\ (u\\preceq v\\lor v\\preceq u)\\land\\forall c\\subseteq D\\ ((b\\subseteq c\\land\\forall u,v\\in c\\ (u\\preceq v\\lor v\\preceq u))\\to c=b)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>极大链定义保留；仅将载体改为实际五元证明对象。良基证明每条分支有限，但各分支的有限长度可以无界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$ 及 $\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle$ 满足 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的 $\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)$；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)","display":false},{"tex":"u\\preceq v","display":false},{"tex":"u=v\\lor u\\prec v","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Branch}(\\pi):=\\{b\\subseteq D:\\forall u,v\\in b\\ (u\\preceq v\\lor v\\preceq u)\\land\\forall c\\subseteq D\\ ((b\\subseteq c\\land\\forall u,v\\in c\\ (u\\preceq v\\lor v\\preceq u))\\to c=b)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1234,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-branch|df-proof-branch — Proof Branch]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-proof-branch|df-proof-branch — Proof Branch]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-proof-branch|72-df-proof-branch]]"}],"outgoing":["81c9c855e009a6d4"]}